n style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">Naima is a </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">beautiful</span></span></strong><strong> </strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">এখানে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">Noun</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">গুণ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">বুঝাচ্ছে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">)</span></span></span></","style=\"color:#111111\">○ Naima is a beautiful girl. (এখানে beautiful, Noun girl-এর গুণ বুঝাচ্ছে)</span></span></span></"],["style=\"color:#111111\">○ </span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">Safi is </span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">good</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\"> boy</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">(</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">Noun</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">অবস্থা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">বুঝাচ্ছে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">)</span></span></span></","style=\"color:#111111\">○ Safi is a good boy. (Noun-এর গুণ বুঝাচ্ছে)</span></span></span></"],["ষা হচ্ছে কোন জাতির মেরুদন্ড, শিক্ষক হচ্ছে শিক্ষার মেরুদন্ড। যে দেশের শিক্ষক যত ভ","ষা হচ্ছে কোন জাতির মেরুদণ্ড, শিক্ষক হচ্ছে শিক্ষার মেরুদণ্ড। যে দেশের শিক্ষক যত ভ"],["serif\"><strong>Education</strong> is the <strong>backbone</strong> of any <strong>nation</strong>; <strong>teachers</strong> are the <strong>backbone</strong> of <strong>education</strong>. The <strong>quality</strong> of a <strong>country&#39;s</strong> <strong>education</strong> <strong>system</strong> is directly proportional to the <strong>quality</strong> of its <strong>teachers</strong>. The <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">better</span></strong> the <strong>teachers</strong> in a <strong>country</strong>, the <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">better</span></strong> its <strong>education</strong> <strong>system</strong>, and consequently, the <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">more</span></strong> advanced and <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">prosperous</span></strong> the <strong>country</strong> and its <strong>people</strong>. A <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">good</span></strong> <strong>teacher</strong> is not necessarily the one who is <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">better</span></strong> than ten <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">bad</span></strong> <strong>teachers</strong> but rather the one who is <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">exemplary</span></strong> in <strong>character</strong>, <strong>behavior</strong>, <strong>morality</strong>, and <strong>conduct</strong> in <strong>speech</strong> and <strong>action</strong>. Such a <strong>teacher</strong> is truly <strong><span style=\"background-color:#2ecc71\">outstanding</span></strong></span><","serif\"><strong>Education is the backbone of a nation, and teachers are the backbone of education. The better the teachers of a country, the better its education system; and the better the education system, the more developed and prosperous the country and its people become. A good teacher is better than ten bad teachers, but a handsome or good-looking teacher is not necessarily a good teacher. One who c