ck\">main verb </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">না</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\"> .</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">তাই</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">am</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">নিজিস্ব</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">কোন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">অর্থ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">নাই</span></span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">এখানে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">verb</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">অধ্যায়</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">থেকে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">প্রতিটি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">verb </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">সম্পর্কে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">ভালোভাবে</span></span> <span style=\"f