Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Lately.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Present Perfect / Simple Past Tense </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Recently </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example: </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সোমবারে</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শ্রেণীতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেরি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এসেছিলেন।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(On Monday, she came to class late.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সর্দি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভালো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নেই।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have been feeling sick lately.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Before and Ago</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Present Perfect, Simple Past, Past Perfect tense </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ক্ষেত্রে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Before.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শুধুমাত্র</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Simple Past Tense</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Ago.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example: </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নাটকটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেখেছি। </span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have seen this drama before)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খাবারটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">৫</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মিনিট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আসেছিল।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(The food arrived 5 minutes ago)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hard and Hardly</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hard </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কঠিন</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hardly </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কদাচিৎ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Verb </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hard</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Verb</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hardly</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দীর্ঘদিন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হাঁটতেন।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(He walks very hard)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খালা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বেশি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বাড়িতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আসেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">না।</span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> (My aunty hardly comes home)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">At present and Presently</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">At present </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Presently</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শীঘ্র</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বর্তমানে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মামার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অ্যাপার্টমেন্টে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থাকছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We are staying in my uncle&rsquo;s apartment at present.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শীঘ্রই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বাড়ি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যাব।<span style=\"font-size:20px\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I will go home presently.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Very and Much</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Positive degree</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Very</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Comparative degree </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">much </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গর্বিত।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We are very proud.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাদিয়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মুনজরিনের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">চেয়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনেক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্রুত।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(Sadia is much quicker than Munjarin.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Well and Good</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Well, Adverb</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হিসেবে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Good, Adjective</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হিসেবে</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; &quot;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হাসান</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভালো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভাবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পড়তে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পারে।</span>&quot; <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(Hasan can read well.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; &quot;<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">একটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভালো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">স্কুলে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পড়তেছিল।</span>&quot; <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(She did good in school.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Gradually and By and by</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Gradually</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">By and by</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অবশেষে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রকল্পের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সম্পর্কে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শেখাচ্ছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(I am teaching about the project gradually.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দুর্ঘটনাকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধীরে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভুলব।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(We will forget this accident gradually.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Since and Ever since</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Since, Present Perfect</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এবং</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Past Perfect Tense</span> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Ever since,</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অতীতের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ঘটনা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝাতে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গতকাল</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থেকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখানে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We have been here since yesterday.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পাঁচ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বছর</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরিচয়</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেছিলাম</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ওই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সময়</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থেকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রতিদিন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অপরকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ফোন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We met five years ago and have been calling each other ever since.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Already, Yet and Still</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Already</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ইতোমধ্যে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ye</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">t </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যন্ত</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Still</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যন্ত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">চলতে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থাকা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কাজ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">লাঞ্চ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ইতিমধ্যে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শেষ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেছি।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have already finished my lunch.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভাই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখনো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যেনো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যায়নি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(My brother has not gone yet.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Fairly and Rather</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">adjective/Adverb </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্বারা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝালে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">, <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fairly</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কিছুতে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">preference</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝালে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">, <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Rather </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">একটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মিথ্যেবাদী</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেন</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কেউই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তাকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">না।</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(He would rather be a liar, even though nobody likes him for that.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সবাই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তাকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দরকার</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কারণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রতিকূল</s