ize:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আবহাওয়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গরম।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(The weather is too hot.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পার্টিতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেরি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেছেন।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(He is too late for the party.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Too+Infinitive</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এটি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্বারা</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কিছু</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">না</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হওয়ার</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কারণ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝায়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাইমা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দৌড়ার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দুর্বল।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(Saima is too weak to run.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কাপটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ধরতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ছোট।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(The cup is too small to catch.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Adjective/Adverb + Enough</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এটি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্বারা</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যথেষ্ট</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">উচিত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মাত্রা</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo; </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝায়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরীক্ষার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যথার্থ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যাপ্তভাবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">চালিত</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নই।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I am not intelligent enough to pass the exam.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গাড়ির</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যাত্রার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আবহাওয়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যথার্থ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যাপ্ত।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(The weather is fair enough for a car ride.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Very much, Too much, Too many</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Very much</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্ণ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">রূপে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> Too much </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনুচিতভাবে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বেশি</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Too many</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনেক</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনেক</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খাবার</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খেয়েছি।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have had too much food now)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তার</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ছেলেকে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভালোবাসেন।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(He loves his son very much )</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Presently and just now</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Future action </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝাতে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Presently </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Past action</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝাতে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &ndash; <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Just now/ Just</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span> </span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শীঘ্রই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বাড়িতে</span> <span style=\"","e=\"color:#111111\">&nbsp;Frequency = He often comes here / I have never seen her</span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">&nbsp;Degree = The mango almost ripe / We are a bit busy today</span></span></span></li>\r\n\t<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">&nbsp;Cause &amp; effect = He was weak so he couldn&rsquo;t win the rac</span><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#111111\">e</span></span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Order</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;=&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">Firstly, we made our dough for the pizza.</span></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">&nbsp; Assertion&nbsp; =&nbsp;I am truly grateful for your help</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Some Uses of adverb with examples&nbsp;</span></span></strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Late and Lately/Recently</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Late </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেরি</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Lately/Recently</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সম্প্রতি</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Present Perfect Tense</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Lately.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Present Perfect / Simple Past Tense </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Recently </span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example: </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সোমবারে</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শ্রেণীতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেরি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এসেছিলেন।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">&nbsp;(On Monday, she came to class late.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সর্দি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভালো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নেই।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have been feeling sick lately.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Before and Ago</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Present Perfect, Simple Past, Past Perfect tense </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ক্ষেত্রে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Before.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শুধুমাত্র</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Simple Past Tense</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">- <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Ago.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example: </span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">নাটকটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দেখেছি। </span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have seen this drama before)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খাবারটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">৫</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মিনিট</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আসেছিল।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(The food arrived 5 minutes ago)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hard and Hardly</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Hard </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কঠিন</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hardly </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কদাচিৎ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Verb </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hard</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Verb</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Hardly</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দীর্ঘদিন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হাঁটতেন।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(He walks very hard)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খালা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বেশি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বাড়িতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আসেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">না।</span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> (My aunty hardly comes home)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">At present and Presently</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">At present </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Presently</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শীঘ্র</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বর্তমানে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মামার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অ্যাপার্টমেন্টে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থাকছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We are staying in my uncle&rsquo;s apartment at present.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শীঘ্রই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বাড়ি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যাব।<span style=\"font-size:20px\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I will go home presently.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Very and Much</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Positive degree</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Very</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Comparative degree </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পূর্বে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">much </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গর্বিত।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We are very proud.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সাদিয়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মুনজরিনের</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">চেয়ে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনেক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্রুত।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(Sadia is much quicker than Munjarin.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Well and Good</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\">Well, Adverb</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হিসেবে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><