an><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অতীতের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ঘটনা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝাতে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ব্যবহৃত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হয়।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গতকাল</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থেকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখানে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We have been here since yesterday.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমরা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পাঁচ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বছর</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আগে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরিচয়</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেছিলাম</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এবং</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ওই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সময়</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থেকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রতিদিন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অপরকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ফোন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আছি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(We met five years ago and have been calling each other ever since.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Already, Yet and Still</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Already</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ইতোমধ্যে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Ye</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">t </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যন্ত</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Still</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শব্দের</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখন</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পর্যন্ত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">চলতে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">থাকা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কাজ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">লাঞ্চ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ইতিমধ্যে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">শেষ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেছি।</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:20px\">(I have already finished my lunch.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আমার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভাই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এখনো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যেনো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">যায়নি।</span> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(My brother has not gone yet.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Fairly and Rather</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">adjective/Adverb </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দ্বারা</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝালে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">, <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Fairly</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span></span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কিছুতে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">preference</span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোঝালে</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">, <span style=\"font-size:20px\">Rather </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বসে।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তিনি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">একটি</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মিথ্যেবাদী</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">হতে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেন</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তবে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কেউই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তাকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">জন্য</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পছন্দ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করেন</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">না।</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:20px\">(He would rather be a liar, even though nobody likes him for that.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span>&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সবাই</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">তাকে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">দরকার</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কারণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রতিকূল</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বোধ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">করে।</span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"> (Everybody admires him because he is fairly intelligent.)</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Too+Adjective/Adverb</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">এর</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অর্থ</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> &lsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অনুচিত</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভাবে</span></span> <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বেশি</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">&rsquo;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">।</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">Example:</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0in; margin-right:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><span style=\"font-family:Symbol\">&middot;</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">আবহাওয়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">খুব</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গরম।</span> <span style=\"font-size:20px\">(The weather is too